                            <comment id="14964430" author="githubbot" created="Tue, 20 Oct 2015 03:06:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user corneadoug opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/353&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/353&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-351&quot; title=&quot;Groups button not working properly on all navigators&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-351&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-351&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; - Can&apos;t remove elems in pivot&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Fix &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-351&quot; title=&quot;Groups button not working properly on all navigators&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-351&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-351&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, On Firefox, we couldn&apos;t remove pivot elements from groups and keys.&lt;br/&gt;
